Your hotspot is not set to 5 GHz, so it may be slow. What should Devpit do?

▌ ▸ Switch my hotspot to 5 GHz
▌   Keeps its name and password. The setting stays on 5 GHz after sharing.

    Use a temporary name and password on 5 GHz
    Your own hotspot settings are not touched.

    Keep it as it is (slower)
    Uses your saved hotspot as it is, which may be on 2.4 GHz.

